## Problem

{input}

## Answer the agent proposed

{answer}

## Answer values the training memory stores

{values}

Rewrite the answer so that it is the answer the problem asks for:
- keep the values the problem supports, spelled exactly as one of the stored values above when that stored value denotes the same answer;
- include any stored value the problem establishes that the proposed answer missed;
- drop any proposed value the problem does not establish.
Reply as JSON: {{"reasoning": "...", "final_answer": "..."}}"""

def pick(task, wrong_n, correct_n, seed=42):
    rs=B.samples(task); rng=random.Random(seed)
    bad=[r for r in rs if not r['was_correct'] and r['status']=='ok']
    good=[r for r in rs if r['was_correct']]
    rng.shuffle(bad); rng.shuffle(good)
    return bad[:wrong_n]+good[:correct_n]

def run_one(task, r):
